   "say": "Twenty-one stations missed every check all week. Thirteen, Warwick, Spicers Peak, Goomburra and Nindooinbah Dam among them, were last measured on 152.400, which nobody has listened to since Saturday the twenty-fourth. They may well be fine. We just cannot hear them."
